{"schemaVersion":1,"generatedAt":"2026-08-02T20:03:34+00:00","item":{"id":"tmdb_movie_289","title":"Касабланка","type":"movie","year":1943,"description":"Оставивший родину американец Рик Блейн, владелец игорного клуба в Касабланке, встречается с покинувшей его несколько лет назад возлюбленной Ильзой, которая приехала в город вместе со своим мужем — борцом антифашистского сопротивления Виктором Лазло. По их следу идут немцы, и Ильза пытается упросить Рика отдать принадлежащие ему важные документы, которые позволят Виктору бежать из Касабланки и продолжить борьбу.","poster":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Commodo163/sys-cache-7c91/main/data/cinema/posters/tmdb_movie_289.jpg","backdrop":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Commodo163/sys-cache-7c91/main/data/cinema/backdrops/tmdb_movie_289.jpg","sources":[{"name":"MVO | SomeWax","format":"hls","sourceId":"zetflix:movie:1:1080p:4","voiceId":"1","voiceName":"MVO | SomeWax","provider":"zetflix","resolverType":"zetflix","resolverData":{"kind":"movie","iframe":"https://54243ba5.obrut.show/embed/AO/kinopoisk/wMzM/","voice":"MVO | SomeWax"},"headers":{"Referer":"https://go.zet-flix.online/","Origin":"https://go.zet-flix.online"},"drm":false,"quality":"1080p","language":"ru"},{"name":"MVO | Film Prestige","format":"hls","sourceId":"zetflix:movie:2:1080p:4","voiceId":"2","voiceName":"MVO | Film Prestige","provider":"zetflix","resolverType":"zetflix","resolverData":{"kind":"movie","iframe":"https://54243ba5.obrut.show/embed/AO/kinopoisk/wMzM/","voice":"MVO | Film Prestige"},"headers":{"Referer":"https://go.zet-flix.online/","Origin":"https://go.zet-flix.online"},"drm":false,"quality":"1080p","language":"ru"},{"name":"MVO | DVD Магия","format":"hls","sourceId":"zetflix:movie:3:1080p:4","voiceId":"3","voiceName":"MVO | DVD Магия","provider":"zetflix","resolverType":"zetflix","resolverData":{"kind":"movie","iframe":"https://54243ba5.obrut.show/embed/AO/kinopoisk/wMzM/","voice":"MVO | DVD Магия"},"headers":{"Referer":"https://go.ze